<p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Our lab space houses a laser cutter, 3D printers, drill press, tabletop saw, adhesives, and a wide assortment of extra hand tools. It also features power supplies, signal generators, oscilloscopes, hand tools, drills, and a medley of electrical components, sensors, and actuators.</p>
<p>        <a href="http://maps.google.com/maps?z=16&amp;q=217%2Bphillips%2Bhall%2Bcornell%2Buniversity%2Bithaca%2C%2Bny%2B14853" style="font-size: 15px;">209 Phillips Hall, Cornell University, Ithaca, NY 14853</a><br>
