<h3 style="font-family: 'Archivo', system-ui, sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; margin: 20px 0 6px; padding-left: 18px; color: #ae1800;">NOTICE</h3>
<p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; max-width: 80ch; padding-left: 16px; border-left: 2px solid #ec3013;">Cornell Maker Club resources are for personal projects only. They are not to be used for classes, research, or project teams. For those categories, please talk with your professor/advisor/team leads or visit the <a href="https://rpl.engineering.cornell.edu/">Rapid Prototyping Lab</a> located in Upson Hall.</p>
